  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab45e3f72055424c",
      "translationZh": "Stable Diffusion 3.5 是其前代 Stable Diffusion 3 的改进版本。从今天起，这些模型已在 Hugging Face Hub 上提供，并可搭配 🧨 Diffusers 使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2237878ef3e70839",
      "translationZh": "本次发布包含两个模型检查点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec82375071c39f09",
      "translationZh": "一个大型（8B）模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bccadde40de54043",
      "translationZh": "一个经过时间步蒸馏、支持少步推理的大型（8B）模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9210ac7487404a2",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将重点介绍如何使用 Diffusers 运行 Stable Diffusion 3.5（SD3.5），涵盖推理和训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "28e82bd4ce497eca",
      "translationZh": "目录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "14c014d3c3153ba1",
      "translationZh": "架构变更",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9c9eb8b80e749605",
      "translationZh": "搭配 Diffusers 使用 SD3.5",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "07fe6b904aa03594",
      "translationZh": "使用量化进行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "de5c7f14b86e21da",
      "translationZh": "使用量化训练 LoRA",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "119428cf9fa21f47",
      "translationZh": "使用单文件加载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38bdd4fc1d80ccae",
      "translationZh": "重要链接",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "14c014d3c3153ba1",
      "translationZh": "架构变更",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "806b6e406439fdc0",
      "translationZh": "SD3.5 (large) 的 Transformer 架构与 SD3 (medium) 非常相似，具体变更如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5f73d1830820afd3",
      "translationZh": "QK 归一化：在训练大型 Transformer 模型时，QK 归一化如今已成为标准做法，SD3.5 Large 也不例外。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a5b46c0cf3cdbca3",
      "translationZh": "双注意力层：SD3.5 在 MMDiT 块中为每个模态流使用双注意力层，而不是单注意力层。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41976c0fb66a4b83",
      "translationZh": "在文本编码器、VAE 和噪声调度器方面，其余细节与 SD3 Medium 完全相同。如需进一步了解 SD3，我们建议查阅原始论文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c9eb8b80e749605",
      "translationZh": "使用 Diffusers 运行 SD3.5",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6a0ec562b943602",
      "translationZh": "请确保安装最新版本的 diffusers：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d71116a23fc39429",
      "translationZh": "由于该模型设有访问门槛，在通过 diffusers 使用它之前，你首先需要前往 Stable Diffusion 3.5 Large 的 Hugging Face 页面，填写表单并接受访问条件。获得访问权限后，你需要登录，以便系统知道你已接受访问条件。使用下面的命令登录：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39ce520d7b3f9b8c",
      "translationZh": "下面的代码片段将以 torch.bfloat16 精度下载 SD3.5 的 8B 参数版本。这是 Stability AI 发布的原始检查点所使用的格式，也是运行推理的推荐方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9875260c6dd09eab",
      "translationZh": "此次发布还包含一个“时间步蒸馏”模型，它无需无分类器引导，让我们能够以更少的步数生成图像（通常为 4-8 步）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf2e2c4fefe4b59b",
      "translationZh": "我们的 SD3 博客文章和 Diffusers 官方文档中展示的所有示例应该都已适用于 SD3.5。特别是，这两份资源都深入探讨了如何优化运行推理所需的内存。由于 SD3.5 Large 明显大于 SD3 Medium，内存优化对于在消费级接口上实现推理至关重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2c492fa8e88ca447",
      "translationZh": "使用量化运行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6ab3986d7a328d7",
      "translationZh": "Diffusers 原生支持使用 bitsandbytes 量化，可进一步优化内存占用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "785bd234bd71c638",
      "translationZh": "首先，确保安装所有必需的库：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6da3665b9fe750e",
      "translationZh": "然后，以“NF4”精度加载 transformer：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ea70157c4108fc7",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们已经准备好运行推理了：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d23c974fb6bf1128",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 BitsAndBytesConfig 中调整其他参数。详情请参阅文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0e89275dca135c7",
      "translationZh": "也可以直接加载使用与上述相同的 nf4_config 量化的模型。这对内存较小的机器尤其有帮助。端到端示例请参阅这个 Colab Notebook。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "34b4b8e9a99a4eb7",
      "translationZh": "通过量化为 SD3.5 Large 训练 LoRA",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c092ca1b3ff4d51",
      "translationZh": "借助 bitsandbytes 和 peft 等库，可以在配备 24GB 显存的消费级 GPU 显卡上微调 SD3.5 Large 这样的大型模型。现在已经可以利用我们现有的 SD3 训练脚本来训练 LoRA。下面的训练命令已经可以使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78feb394d2037c9c",
      "translationZh": "不过，要让它与量化配合使用，我们需要调整几个参数。下面介绍如何进行这些调整：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8e006bbf6b3e3a17",
      "translationZh": "我们可以使用量化配置来初始化 transformer，也可以直接加载已量化的检查点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4d0004400c12673",
      "translationZh": "然后，我们使用 peft 中的 prepare_model_for_kbit_training() 对它进行准备。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b4e62944b90c1858",
      "translationZh": "得益于 peft 对 bitsandbytes 的强大支持，其余流程保持不变！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba9998649afa80ee",
      "translationZh": "更完整的示例请参阅此示例脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6f21c900d05966c8",
      "translationZh": "对 Stable Diffusion 3.5 Transformer 使用单文件加载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5214c44cca081385",
      "translationZh": "你可以通过 from_single_file 方法，使用 Stability AI 发布的原始检查点文件加载 Stable Diffusion 3.5 Transformer 模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
